000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. FLOWS.
000003*SYNTHETIC SEPA FEE POSTING, USED FOR FIELD-LEVEL LINEAGE TESTS
000004 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000005 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000006 FILE-CONTROL.
000007     SELECT TXN-IN ASSIGN TO TXNIN.
000008     SELECT RPT-OUT ASSIGN TO RPTOUT.
000009 DATA DIVISION.
000010 FILE SECTION.
000011 FD  TXN-IN.
000012 01  TXN-REC                 PIC X(80).
000013 FD  RPT-OUT.
000014 01  RPT-REC                 PIC X(80).
000015 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000016 01  WS-TXN.
000017     05  WS-AMOUNT           PIC S9(7)V99.
000018     05  WS-FEE              PIC S9(5)V99.
000019 01  WS-TOTALS.
000020     05  WS-AMOUNT           PIC S9(9)V99.
000021     05  WS-NET              PIC S9(9)V99.
000022 01  WS-RATE                 PIC V9(4) VALUE .0150.
000023 01  WS-LINE                 PIC X(80).
000024 01  WS-TARGET-PGM           PIC X(8).
000025 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000026 MAIN-PARA.
000027     READ TXN-IN INTO WS-TXN
000028     COMPUTE WS-FEE OF WS-TXN =
000029         WS-AMOUNT OF WS-TXN * WS-RATE
000030     ADD WS-AMOUNT OF WS-TXN TO WS-AMOUNT OF WS-TOTALS
000031     SUBTRACT WS-FEE FROM WS-AMOUNT OF WS-TXN
000032         GIVING WS-NET
000033     MOVE WS-NET TO WS-LINE
000034     WRITE RPT-REC FROM WS-LINE
000035     MOVE 'SUBPGM' TO WS-TARGET-PGM
000036     CALL WS-TARGET-PGM USING WS-NET
000037     MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO WS-LINE
000038     STOP RUN.
